# Mainnet go-live (locked)

Read [Resources/mainnet-golive.md](../../Resources/mainnet-golive.md) before any mainnet contract, Graph, relayer allowlist, or `NEAR_NETWORK=mainnet` change.

**Label:** mainnet is token + rewards + treasury. Testnet is the product network.

**Do not**

- Flip app / portal / gateway to mainnet
- Point public Graph or substreams at mainnet as if core exists
- Deploy `core` (or any missing account) without following the runbook order
- Retrack views or `reload_metadata` on the public Hasura engine
- Allowlist a name that has no wasm
- Treat UI shipping on `main` as mainnet social going live

**When the chain changes:** update `Resources/mainnet-golive.md` and `scripts/check-mainnet-contracts.mjs` in the same change. Re-check with `node scripts/check-mainnet-contracts.mjs`.
